I come out of the fitting room.
There is a mirror there.
Near the mirror, there is an excellent scarf.
That scarf's colour is red.
I look at that red scarf.
It is not small, it is large.
I look at the scarf's price tag.
Its price is very low.
I touch the fabric.
This fabric is very soft.
I wear that large scarf on my shoulder.
I look in the mirror.
That red scarf is excellent.
I look at the shopkeeper.
"Brother, I want this," I say.
I carry that scarf in my hand.
